sequenceDiagram
    participant Test as Test Script
    participant Daemon as odc-onboard Daemon
    participant EventBus as EventBus
    participant Mgr as RtspCompressorManager
    participant Bridge as RtspBridge
    participant Kernel as Linux Kernel

    Test->>Kernel: create TUN iface test-cmpr0
    Test->>Kernel: ip link set test-cmpr0 up
    Test->>Daemon: start daemon (rtsp: enabled)

    Note over Daemon: startup() creates RtspCompressorManager
    Note over Daemon: start_ipc_server() calls mgr->start()

    Test->>Kernel: ip addr add 10.77.1.1/24 dev test-cmpr0

    Kernel-->>Daemon: Netlink RTNL: address added
    Daemon->>EventBus: publish VpnInterfaceEvent(AddressAdded, IPv4, 10.77.1.1)
    EventBus->>Mgr: on_vpn_interface_event()

    Note over Mgr: auto_enabled_ && !ipv6 && !ip_empty → spawn

    Mgr->>Mgr: spawn_compressor(conn_id, iface, ip)
    Mgr->>Bridge: new RtspBridge(orchestrator)
    Mgr->>Bridge: bridge->start(config)
    Mgr->>Mgr: spawn std::thread + GMainLoop
    Mgr->>EventBus: publish RtspCompressorStatusEvent(running=true)

    Test->>Daemon: CLI: rtsp status
    Daemon-->>Test: test-cmpr0: running yes

    Note over Test,Daemon: === Teardown phase ===

    Test->>Kernel: ip addr del 10.77.1.1/24 dev test-cmpr0
    Kernel-->>Daemon: Netlink RTNL: address removed
    Daemon->>EventBus: publish VpnInterfaceEvent(AddressRemoved)
    EventBus->>Mgr: on_vpn_interface_event()
    Mgr->>Bridge: g_main_loop_quit(loop)
    Bridge-->>Mgr: thread joins, bridge->stop()
    Mgr->>EventBus: publish RtspCompressorStatusEvent(running=false)

    Test->>Daemon: CLI: rtsp status
    Daemon-->>Test: No compressor instances

    Test->>Kernel: ip link set test-cmpr0 down
    Test->>Kernel: ip tuntap del test-cmpr0
    Test->>Daemon: SIGTERM
